~ start
Fiona: Good morning, sir !
- Good morning
- Hey
=> fiona_main

~ start50
Fiona: Good afternoon, sir !
- Good afternoon
- Hey
=> fiona_main

~ fiona_main
Fiona: I'm sorry I can't help you with all these towers.
- It's okay, you'll get your licence later...
	Fiona: Yeah... Maybe... It's the second time I failed the exam tho !
	- You'll make it, I have faith in you !
	- Everyone fails their first couple of tries !
	Fiona: Is that true ?
	Fiona: You don't know how much this means to me !
	Fiona: Oh, sorry ! You have a lot of work to do !
- Yeah...
	Fiona: ...
	Fiona: Oh, sorry... You have a lot of work to do !
- You can watch if you want
	Fiona: I can ?
	- Of course
	Fiona: Yeaaah !
	Fiona: But my mom said I shouldn't go too far, I'll watch you from a distance.
Fiona: I don't want to be a burden
if GlobalVars.tower_amount == GlobalVars.tower_completed:
	- Yeah, I should get back to work !
		Fiona: You're right ! See you around !
	- I finished it
		Fiona: You did ? Really ? Wow, you're so cool !
		Fiona: I can't wait to be like you someday !
		$> title = "fiona wait"
		=> fiona_wait
else:
	- Yeah, I should hurry back to work !
	Fiona: See you later !
=> END

~ fiona_wait
Fiona: ... So... What do you want to do now ?
- We can wait, to truly appreciate each others presence
	while true:
		[wait=3]
		Fiona: ... sooo... Did we wait enough ?
		- No, not yet
		- Yeah
			Fiona: It was really nice waiting around with you !
			Fiona: Maybe wa can do that another time ?
			=> END
- Do you want to play tic tac toe ?
	Fiona: Yeaaah
	$> MainCommunicator.send_signal_to_main(MainCommunicator.SignalType.ADD_MINIGAME, [load("res://src/minigames/tic_tac_toe/tic_tac_toe.tscn"), {"computer_playstyle":1}])
- Do you want to play connect 4 ?
	Fiona: I am really bad, tho
	$> MainCommunicator.send_signal_to_main(MainCommunicator.SignalType.ADD_MINIGAME, [load("res://src/minigames/connect4/connect_4.tscn"), {"computer_playstyle":1}])
=> END